{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/824c454951f6051abad5100b15ed4c01.avif?t=1772010304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras_big/824c454951f6051abad5100b15ed4c01.avif?t=1772010304 width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hajwala isn\u2019t typical drifting, it\u2019s a vibe straight from the Gulf streets. Drift the Arab way, go into high speed and lose control on the highway. It\u2019s all about sliding sideways with style on highways and open roads, showing o\ufb00 your skills while staying in full control. It\u2019s loud, wild, and a lot of fun. In Highway Drifter: Hajwala Simulator you get to feel all that energy. Whether you\u2019re cruising the desert or speeding through mountain roads, it\u2019s your chance to shine. Think you got what it takes to drift like a real Muhajwel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/0f74c0ea3b9f256c8e4e05690dce4467.webp?t=1772010304\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/0f74c0ea3b9f256c8e4e05690dce4467.poster.avif?t=1772010304\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=199 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/9844a8b6d5bf87ab48b4a07ed42bdd88.avif?t=1772010304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras_big/9844a8b6d5bf87ab48b4a07ed42bdd88.avif?t=1772010304 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize everything during gameplay, your car is all about your style. Pick your favorite shade of color and choose your tint level, switch up the rims, and mix and match front and back bumpers to match your style. You can even customize your license plate to make it totally yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/07aa2dd385e22ff4e33a461265277fcd.poster.avif?t=1772010304\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/07aa2dd385e22ff4e33a461265277fcd.webm?t=1772010304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/07aa2dd385e22ff4e33a461265277fcd.mp4?t=1772010304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/2abdd12c6f773d711aede2f5b436a165.avif?t=1772010304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras_big/2abdd12c6f773d711aede2f5b436a165.avif?t=1772010304 width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highway Drifter has an advanced car physics tuning system, you have full control on your car build, you can change car speed, max engine torque, suspension, gear ratios, car weight, you name it, you can edit it. Create di\ufb00erent custom tuning setups, including drift, hajwala, drag, or even low speed cruising, the tuning has no limits, you can even break it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/ba567ef82d9ecbbb856db53eca8a8133.poster.avif?t=1772010304\" width=700 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/ba567ef82d9ecbbb856db53eca8a8133.webm?t=1772010304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/dd599e4a26be8b022599702ae17ea03f.avif?t=1772010304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras_big/dd599e4a26be8b022599702ae17ea03f.avif?t=1772010304 width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across hot desert roads, drift through the narrow streets of European cities, or take on sharp turns in the rocky canyon mountains. Each map brings a new style, a new feel, and a new challenge. No matter where you drive, your skills will be tested. Are you ready to drift through them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/cf759f8b299b8dd205f212a1452c1152.poster.avif?t=1772010304\" width=800 height=461 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/cf759f8b299b8dd205f212a1452c1152.webm?t=1772010304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\tLooking Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2761820/e0db7f138cfe293c33ef76ae654a16b0585c392d.jpg"},{"name":"The Mechanic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2761820/aa1ebaae5c615cacd42d35296774a2723bca7dce.jpg"},{"name":"I've seen enough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2761820/5e134bf0c4886d12a7920930d9e73ae4c5c89098.jpg"},{"name":"Have you seen the city ?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2761820/628d28045a79f083c153f2568a391ab500e8f2bf.jpg"},{"name":"Desert Heat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2761820/74b811da7a151cd0693ee00b751fb6e165db5423.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2761820?t=1772010304","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772010304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/652eb6c19c28e06bfe5d663a349427da975d4834/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772010304","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/652eb6c19c28e06bfe5d663a349427da975d4834/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772010304","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/824c454951f6051abad5100b15ed4c01.avif?t=1772010304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras_big/824c454951f6051abad5100b15ed4c01.avif?t=1772010304 width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hajwala isn\u2019t typical drifting, it\u2019s a vibe straight from the Gulf streets. Drift the Arab way, go into high speed and lose control on the highway. It\u2019s all about sliding sideways with style on highways and open roads, showing o\ufb00 your skills while staying in full control. It\u2019s loud, wild, and a lot of fun. In Highway Drifter: Hajwala Simulator you get to feel all that energy. Whether you\u2019re cruising the desert or speeding through mountain roads, it\u2019s your chance to shine. Think you got what it takes to drift like a real Muhajwel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/0f74c0ea3b9f256c8e4e05690dce4467.webp?t=1772010304\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/0f74c0ea3b9f256c8e4e05690dce4467.poster.avif?t=1772010304\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=199 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/9844a8b6d5bf87ab48b4a07ed42bdd88.avif?t=1772010304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras_big/9844a8b6d5bf87ab48b4a07ed42bdd88.avif?t=1772010304 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize everything during gameplay, your car is all about your style. Pick your favorite shade of color and choose your tint level, switch up the rims, and mix and match front and back bumpers to match your style. You can even customize your license plate to make it totally yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/07aa2dd385e22ff4e33a461265277fcd.poster.avif?t=1772010304\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761820/extras/07aa2dd385e22ff4e33a461265277fcd.webm?t=1772010304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">